2026-10-29 21:28:45,354 - app.packages.collect_news - INFO - Existing record: {'id': UUID('01a187d0-910a-716c-908d-67ee4996fc6c'), 'title': "Nvidia's $12.9 billion Hugging Face deal draws DOJ scrutiny", 'link': 'https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/28/doj-questions-nvidias-12point9-billion-hugging-face-deal.html', 'snippet': "Nvidia faces DOJ inquiry over its $12.9 billion purchase of Hugging Face.\nHugging Face already had massive adoption. At the time of the deal, Nvidia said in a press statement that more than 18 million people and more than 200,000 companies reportedly used Hugging Face to share at least 3 million models and 500,000 datasets.\nThe U.S. Department of Justice is investigating Nvidia and has asked it for information about how its $12.9 billion acquisition of Hugging Face could impact competitors.\nThe Hugging Face deal marked Nvidia's second-biggest purchase, after it paid $20 billion for Groq assets at the end of last year.\nJensen Huang, co-founder, president and CEO of Nvidia, gestures during a press briefing in Paris on Oct.", 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 29, 4, 19, 14, 832989, tzinfo=zoneinfo.ZoneInfo(key='Etc/UTC')), 'source': 'www.cnbc.com', 'article_language': None, 'article_type': 'news', 'content': None, 'content_status': None, 'content_error': None, 'embedding': None, 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 29, 13, 19, 14, 855725, tzinfo=zoneinfo.ZoneInfo(key='Etc/UTC')), 'last_updated': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 29, 13, 19, 14, 855725, tzinfo=zoneinfo.ZoneInfo(key='Etc/UTC'))}
