2026-10-29 21:57:53,511 - app.packages.collect_news - INFO - Existing record: {'id': UUID('01a187da-0d6a-7dcb-9654-c1be6e85af1b'), 'title': 'Agencies test emergency response plans | The Star', 'link': 'https://www.thestar.com.my/metro/metro-news/2026/10/29/agencies-test-emergency-response-plans', 'snippet': 'Security agencies in Selangor convened in Petaling Jaya for a joint tabletop exercise to test emergency response plans during a simulated public order threat.\nAhmad Fadzli (left) pointing at a map used in the tabletop exercise simulating a riot in Petaling Jaya. — ART CHEN/The Star · Security agencies in Selangor convened in Petaling Jaya for a joint tabletop exercise to test emergency response plans during a simulated public order threat.\nSelangor State Secretary Datuk Dr Ahmad Fadzli Ahmad Tajuddin said such exercises allowed agencies to identify weaknesses, gaps, overlapping roles or communication problems before a real incident occurs. “The findings from this exercise must be translated into follow-up action and improvements by each agency,” he said when launching the exercise at Dewan D’Kelana, Petaling Jaya.\nTags / Keywords: Selangor National Security Council , MKN , MBPJ , Petaling Jaya , Glenmarie LRT Station.', 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 29, 8, 29, 35, 607569, tzinfo=zoneinfo.ZoneInfo(key='Etc/UTC')), 'source': 'www.thestar.com.my', 'article_language': None, 'article_type': 'news', 'content': None, 'content_status': None, 'content_error': None, 'embedding': None, 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 29, 13, 29, 35, 632661, tzinfo=zoneinfo.ZoneInfo(key='Etc/UTC')), 'last_updated': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 29, 13, 29, 35, 632661, tzinfo=zoneinfo.ZoneInfo(key='Etc/UTC'))}
